{
  "assembly_notes": "The host-level topology is a single `shield_system` slot. `soft_bifold` and `tactical_bifold` each own one source-matched top hinge and one child support panel whose local body extends along -Z; the registered axis mate applies the source deploy pitch at q=0 so the support reaches rearward/downward instead of stacking above the shield. `curved_handheld` and `round_handheld` own no fold rail, support leaf, or support joint. Viewport, grip, and grip_mount remain independent and adapt to every structural family through real aperture and rear-seat interfaces. core_domain = 4 x 3 x 3 x 2 = 72; there is no multiplicity axis. Palette is decorative and excluded.",
